    {
      "id": "826793178658160640",
      "title": "",
      "link": "https://shelestvetrovki.tumblr.com/post/826793178658160640/three-years-ago-you-decided-to-take-a-calling",
      "date": "2026-09-04 03:10:19 GMT",
      "rows": [
        [
          "https://64.media.tumblr.com/70765ece571a97c3bf0cb55fa31ef730/a5692d58753dcb6c-fe/s640x960/d4888d5b0c3b747571cbf070b76c41f6ff87f535.jpg"
        ],
        [
          "https://64.media.tumblr.com/a343cf93cd0f6d5c4e878b612b960692/a5692d58753dcb6c-b2/s640x960/4711e1dd0fb3cb54cd306b6322c0bf95345ee7a2.jpg"
        ]
      ],
      "text": "three years ago you decided to take a calling within your soul. sometimes you look back at your childhood and get really shocked by how far you have come. there will be a real war between humans in your early twenties, and there will be a heartbreaking breakup with the love of your life, and you will feel so small and lightweight that the circumstances and events will swirl you like a feather in the wind, very far and very fast. it will be the age of earthquakes and thunderstorms. it will be the time of deaths and rebirths. many lives will pass, and somehow you will remain, swirling further and further from where you came from. not many people will do what you do, and not many will understand where you’re coming from. it’s very important that you see the child who started this all and do not forget what it took for her to survive.",
      "is_reblog": false,
      "reblog_from": null,
      "reblog_url": null
    },
